@host = https://localhost:7005

### 1. Login as Athens owner — RUN THIS, then copy the "token" from the response
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "owner@athens.test",
  "password": "Owner123!"
}

### 2. Login as Thessaloniki owner — RUN, then copy its token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "owner@thessaloniki.test",
  "password": "Owner123!"
}

### 3.Copy Tokens
@athens = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..MGgGZ4ujeLEkAyMQrDkLzfO4LECIf7UaVL4hHlw0gx0
@thess = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..XapiZXCGKxT4MoZLI6mqZxzDJEq55UVFTWFgSdOZe94

### 1. Athens creates a branch
POST {{host}}/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

{
  "name": "Athens Κέντρο"
}

### 2. Athens creates a second branch
POST {{host}}/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

{
  "name": "Athens Πλατεία"
}

### 3. Athens lists — expect BOTH Athens branches
GET {{host}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### 4. Thessaloniki creates a branch
POST {{host}}/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{thess}}

{
  "name": "Thessaloniki Λιμάνι"
}

### 5. Thessaloniki lists — expect ONLY "Thessaloniki Λιμάνι"
GET {{host}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{thess}}

### 6. Athens lists AGAIN — still ONLY the two Athens branches
GET {{host}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### Get Athens branches — copy a branchId from the response
GET {{host}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### Create a floor in that Athens branch (put the branchId in the URL)
POST {{host}}/api/branches/0c9d9f59-17a7-f111-a815-ec750c313aef/floors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

{
  "name": "Υπόγειο"
}

### List floors of that Athens branch
GET {{host}}/api/branches/0c9d9f59-17a7-f111-a815-ec750c313aef/floors
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### ISOLATION TEST: Thessaloniki tries the SAME Athens branchId — expect EMPTY
GET {{host}}/api/branches/0c9d9f59-17a7-f111-a815-ec750c313aef/floors
Authorization: Bearer {{thess}}

### Get floors of an Athens branch — copy a floorId
GET {{host}}/api/branches/PASTE_ATHENS_BRANCH_ID/floors
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### Create a spot on that floor
POST {{host}}/api/floors/PASTE_FLOOR_ID/spots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

{
  "number": "A1",
  "size": 2
}

### List spots of that floor
GET {{host}}/api/floors/PASTE_FLOOR_ID/spots
Authorization: Bearer {{athens}}

### ISOLATION: Thessaloniki tries the same Athens floorId — expect EMPTY
GET {{host}}/api/floors/PASTE_FLOOR_ID/spots
Authorization: Bearer {{thess}}